{
    "title": "Beauty Camera: Sweet Camera",
    "description": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera is the all-in-one camera app and beauty editor that provides everything you need to create sweet and beautiful photos and video selfies. With this perfect Beauty Camera, you can effortlessly generate unique pictures with fashion makeup and stickers, face&body retouching and makeup filters.</b> Let's enjoy advanced AI beauty techonology and photo and video editing tools with beauty camera.\r\n\r\n<b>Selfie Camera & Beauty Camera is also the best makeup camera & collage and photo editing app. Try the best makeup effects, top brand beauty products, cute AR stickers, filters, watermarks, amazing collages and fonts.</b> Find your favorite version of yourself by creating custom beauty effects: smooth skin, face reshape, whiten teeth, hair color changer, costume makeup, eyeliner, eyelashes, contour, blush, eyebrows, try contacts to change eye color, retouch eye shape for larger eyes.\r\n\r\nFree download and use all powerful features! Don't miss the popular professional Beauty camera - HD Camera and photo/video editing app. Snap and edit sweet selfies and short videos, then just one tap to share to any social media platforms! \ud83d\udc84\ud83d\udcf7\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Enjoy the Best Makeup and Perfect Selfies</b> \ud83d\udc51\r\n* <b>Makeup effects:</b> various trendy makeup themes make you a superstar\r\n* <b>Beauty camera:</b> HD camera and retouch for a natural, stunning selfie and video\r\n* <b>Whiten and flawless skin:</b> remove blemish, erasing dark circles and under-eye bags\r\n* <b>Cute stickers and filters:</b> thousands of AR filters and live stickers\r\n* <b>Lipstick and eye makeup:</b> one tap to add lipstick and eye color to make you attractive\r\n* <b>Retouch and Face Tune:</b> smooth wrinkles, slim face, reshape faces, remove red eyes, adjust smile\r\n* <b>Auto-beautifying tools:</b> Plump lips, teeth whitening, enlarge and brighten eyes, reshape cheekbones, forehead\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8b <b>Makeup Effects, Stickers and Filters Make Sweet Selfies</b> \r\n* <b>Real-Time AR makeup:</b> try cosmetics from top beauty brands with Live Makeup Camera\r\n* <b>Unique Stickers:</b> cute animal, tattoo, holiday, emoji, animated stickers\r\n* <b>Foundation and Blush:</b> one-tap face tune and color brushes that match every skin tone\r\n* <b>Lips and eye editor:</b> Get plump lips with lipstick and different eyelashes, eyeliner, eyebrows, eye shadow and contact lenses\r\n* <b>Contour and Highlight:</b> cheekbone & nose reshape and hair color changer\r\n* <b>Perfect selfie filters:</b> cartoon yourself with AI Anime camera or Anime filter\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d <b>Beauty Editing Tools and Photo & Video Editor</b>\r\n* <b>Beauty Effects:</b> Apply filters and trendy makeup looks to set the desired atmosphere\r\n* <b>Body Editor:</b> Increase your height and adjust your breasts, waist, arms, face and more\r\n* <b>Sweet Camera with accessories:</b> apply real-time filters, glasses, earrings and necklaces\r\n* <b>Picture Editing:</b> adjust the size and ratio. adding frames, text, stickers, posters.\r\n* <b>Video editor:</b> edit videos easily with music and turn your daily life into a music video\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 <b>Beautify Photos with Photo Collage and Makeup Editor</b>\r\n* <b>Pretty Makeup and sweet snap:</b> retouch beautiful photos by using the make up editor \r\n* <b>Photo Repair and Enhance:</b> fix your old blurry photos and increase image resolution\r\n* <b>Background Eraser:</b> Change background to give your photos a fresh look\r\n* <b>Magic Brush and Mosaic:</b> Doodle and cover anything that you want to hide\r\n* <b>Photo Grid:</b> plenty of collage templates and create collage that reflect your charming picture art\r\n* <b>Beauty Sweet:</b> control color and lighting, contrast, saturation, hue, shadows, fade\r\n\r\nDownload Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera & Makeup Camera to choose makeup, sticker, filters, watermarks to make your HD photo and videos stand out, and share them to Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, Whatsapp, Pinterest, Tik Tok, Snapchat to get more likes. \ud83d\udc95\ud83e\udd33",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera is the all-in-one camera app and beauty editor that provides everything you need to create sweet and beautiful photos and video selfies. With this perfect Beauty Camera, you can effortlessly generate unique pictures with fashion makeup and stickers, face&amp;body retouching and makeup filters.</b> Let&#39;s enjoy advanced AI beauty techonology and photo and video editing tools with beauty camera.<br><br><b>Selfie Camera &amp; Beauty Camera is also the best makeup camera &amp; collage and photo editing app. Try the best makeup effects, top brand beauty products, cute AR stickers, filters, watermarks, amazing collages and fonts.</b> Find your favorite version of yourself by creating custom beauty effects: smooth skin, face reshape, whiten teeth, hair color changer, costume makeup, eyeliner, eyelashes, contour, blush, eyebrows, try contacts to change eye color, retouch eye shape for larger eyes.<br><br>Free download and use all powerful features! Don&#39;t miss the popular professional Beauty camera - HD Camera and photo/video editing app. Snap and edit sweet selfies and short videos, then just one tap to share to any social media platforms! \ud83d\udc84\ud83d\udcf7<br><br>\u2728 <b>Enjoy the Best Makeup and Perfect Selfies</b> \ud83d\udc51<br>* <b>Makeup effects:</b> various trendy makeup themes make you a superstar<br>* <b>Beauty camera:</b> HD camera and retouch for a natural, stunning selfie and video<br>* <b>Whiten and flawless skin:</b> remove blemish, erasing dark circles and under-eye bags<br>* <b>Cute stickers and filters:</b> thousands of AR filters and live stickers<br>* <b>Lipstick and eye makeup:</b> one tap to add lipstick and eye color to make you attractive<br>* <b>Retouch and Face Tune:</b> smooth wrinkles, slim face, reshape faces, remove red eyes, adjust smile<br>* <b>Auto-beautifying tools:</b> Plump lips, teeth whitening, enlarge and brighten eyes, reshape cheekbones, forehead<br><br>\ud83d\udc8b <b>Makeup Effects, Stickers and Filters Make Sweet Selfies</b> <br>* <b>Real-Time AR makeup:</b> try cosmetics from top beauty brands with Live Makeup Camera<br>* <b>Unique Stickers:</b> cute animal, tattoo, holiday, emoji, animated stickers<br>* <b>Foundation and Blush:</b> one-tap face tune and color brushes that match every skin tone<br>* <b>Lips and eye editor:</b> Get plump lips with lipstick and different eyelashes, eyeliner, eyebrows, eye shadow and contact lenses<br>* <b>Contour and Highlight:</b> cheekbone &amp; nose reshape and hair color changer<br>* <b>Perfect selfie filters:</b> cartoon yourself with AI Anime camera or Anime filter<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d <b>Beauty Editing Tools and Photo &amp; Video Editor</b><br>* <b>Beauty Effects:</b> Apply filters and trendy makeup looks to set the desired atmosphere<br>* <b>Body Editor:</b> Increase your height and adjust your breasts, waist, arms, face and more<br>* <b>Sweet Camera with accessories:</b> apply real-time filters, glasses, earrings and necklaces<br>* <b>Picture Editing:</b> adjust the size and ratio. adding frames, text, stickers, posters.<br>* <b>Video editor:</b> edit videos easily with music and turn your daily life into a music video<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 <b>Beautify Photos with Photo Collage and Makeup Editor</b><br>* <b>Pretty Makeup and sweet snap:</b> retouch beautiful photos by using the make up editor <br>* <b>Photo Repair and Enhance:</b> fix your old blurry photos and increase image resolution<br>* <b>Background Eraser:</b> Change background to give your photos a fresh look<br>* <b>Magic Brush and Mosaic:</b> Doodle and cover anything that you want to hide<br>* <b>Photo Grid:</b> plenty of collage templates and create collage that reflect your charming picture art<br>* <b>Beauty Sweet:</b> control color and lighting, contrast, saturation, hue, shadows, fade<br><br>Download Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera &amp; Makeup Camera to choose makeup, sticker, filters, watermarks to make your HD photo and videos stand out, and share them to Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, Whatsapp, Pinterest, Tik Tok, Snapchat to get more likes. \ud83d\udc95\ud83e\udd33",
